  "ingredients": [
    "1/2 teaspoon ground cloves",
    "1 1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1/2 cup erythritol",
    "1 1/2 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "1/2 cup pumpkin puree",
    "2 large egg",
    "1/4 cup coconut oil",
    "2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/2 teaspoon apple cider vinegar",
    "30 gram low-carb dark chocolate (such as ChocoPerfection)",
    "1/2 cup pistachio nuts"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 325F. Grind the cloves using a spice grinder or mortar and pestle.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large mixing bowl, add the almond flour, erythritol, cinnamon, baking soda, nutmeg, and cloves. If using ground and dried ginger, add that in now as well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, combine the pumpkin puree, eggs, coconut oil, vanilla, and apple cider vinegar. If using minced (wet) ginger, add it in here.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop the chocolate bars.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix all of the wet ingredients well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix all of the dry ingredients well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour half of the wet ingredients into the dry ingredients and gently mix them. Add the remaining wet ingredients and mix to combine thoroughly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold the chocolate chunks and pistachios into the mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line the cupcake tray with cupcake liners and evenly distribute the batter between them.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake the muffins for 25–30 minutes or until golden brown (mine took 27 minutes exactly). Remove from the oven and let cool for 15 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Store the muffins in a Tupperware container and enjoy an excellent on-the-go breakfast!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/pistachio-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins/#wprm-recipe-50813-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/pistachio-and-pumpkin-chocolate-muffins-step-11.jpg"
    }
  ],
